# A Borg Assimilator drains a Klingon destroyer's crew with its Auto-Assimilator. Both ships are set to green alert so
# nothing fires. The Assimilator is selected, F3 is pressed, and the destroyer clicked (the special step). The weapon moves
# 5 crew per second from the destroyer to the Assimilator until the destroyer has less than one crew and is derelict. The
# drain never captures: the destroyer keeps team 2 and the race klingon, and the Assimilator's crew above its maximum goes
# to team 1's crew pool.
# Run it with --layout layouts/auto-assimilator.jsonc; the layout's header comment has the whole command.
wait 0.5
select Victim
press Shift+G
select Assimilator
press Shift+G
expect Victim team = 2
expect Victim race = klingon
special 3 Victim
wait 30
dump drained
expect Victim crew = 0
expect Victim team = 2
expect Victim race = klingon
expect Assimilator crew >= 200
expect Assimilator pool > 30
